onferences.&nbsp;The&nbsp;caller&nbsp;stated&nbsp;that&nbsp;Lemont&nbsp;is&nbsp;diagnosed&nbsp;with&nbsp;Autism.&nbsp;&nbsp;Report&nbsp;also&nbsp;revealed&nbsp;that&nbsp;Shalonda’s&nbsp;parental&nbsp;visitation&nbsp;with&nbsp;Lemont&nbsp;has&nbsp;been&nbsp;sporadic.&nbsp;The&nbsp;caller&nbsp;reported&nbsp;that&nbsp;during&nbsp;the&nbsp;few&nbsp;visitations,&nbsp;the&nbsp;biological&nbsp;mother&nbsp;does&nbsp;not&nbsp;provide&nbsp;any&nbsp;financial&nbsp;assistance&nbsp;to&nbsp;support&nbsp;Lemont&#39;s&nbsp;needs.&nbsp;Report&nbsp;also&nbsp;indicated&nbsp;that&nbsp;Ms.&nbsp;Sholanda&nbsp;will&nbsp;promise&nbsp;to&nbsp;bring&nbsp;some&nbsp;money&nbsp;and&nbsp;food&nbsp;stamps&nbsp;to&nbsp;Ms.&nbsp;Sparks&nbsp;but&nbsp;she&nbsp;never&nbsp;does.&nbsp;This&nbsp;report&nbsp;information&nbsp;indicated&nbsp;that&nbsp;child&#39;s&nbsp;grandmother&nbsp;is&nbsp;tired&nbsp;of&nbsp;using&nbsp;her&nbsp;&nbsp;own&nbsp;benefits&nbsp;to&nbsp;feed&nbsp;and&nbsp;cloth&nbsp;Lemont&nbsp;because&nbsp;she&nbsp;&nbsp;is&nbsp;on&nbsp;fixed&nbsp;income&nbsp;of&nbsp;nine&nbsp;hundred&nbsp;dollars&nbsp;a&nbsp;month.&nbsp;This&nbsp;reported&nbsp;information&nbsp;is&nbsp;revealing&nbsp;that&nbsp;child&#39;s&nbsp;grandmother&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;mentally&nbsp;and&nbsp;emotionally&nbsp;affected&nbsp;if&nbsp;her&nbsp;grandchild&nbsp;is&nbsp;removed&nbsp;from&nbsp;her&nbsp;home&nbsp;and&nbsp;care&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;result&nbsp;of&nbsp;this&nbsp;&nbsp;DSS/CPS&nbsp;investigation,&nbsp;due&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;attachment&nbsp;and&nbsp;bounding&nbsp;the&nbsp;child&nbsp;and&nbsp;his&nbsp;grandmother&nbsp;have&nbsp;developed&nbsp;&nbsp;for&nbsp;each&nbsp;other&nbsp;over&nbsp;the&nbsp;years.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p></p><p></p>","AgencyCode":"CW","Middlename":"","CreatedDate":"2026-03-19T16:56:05.041Z","InputSource":"0bdda2ab-b74f-4d74-ba17-3b9b37a9ca19","PurposeName":"Child Protective Services","RecivedDate":"03/19/2026 12:56:05 P